# Line endings.
#
# The discipline linters read text with awk, sed and grep, and a stray CR is
# invisible in a diff while changing what a pattern matches. A review round
# showed both directions of the damage: a CRLF backlog.md made backlog-lint
# report OK having checked nothing, and a CRLF .expect file could never match the
# message it named, with a diagnostic whose "wanted" and "got" lines looked
# identical on screen.
#
# This normalises the files the kit's own checks read. It protects this
# repository; it does not protect an adopter who does not copy it, so the linters
# themselves must still tolerate CR — see issue #39.
*.md      text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.expect  text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
